on in space that contains $R,$ then the divergence theorem states that\n\n$$\n{∬}_{S}F\\cdot dS={∭}_{R}\\text{div}\\,F\\,\\text{d}V.\n$$\n\nComputing the divergence of $F,$ we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\text{div}\\,F & =\\frac{∂}{∂x}(3 x + 1)+\\frac{∂}{∂y}(3z)+\\frac{∂}{∂z}(xy) \\\\  & =3+0+0 \\\\  & =3.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nLet $R$ be the solid region enclosed by $S.$ Then, using the divergence theorem, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{∬}_{S}F\\cdot dS & ={∭}_{R}3\\,\\text{d}V \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{4}{\\int }_{0}^{3}{\\int }_{0}^{2}3\\,\\text{d}z\\,\\text{d}y\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{4}3\\,\\text{d}x\\cdot {\\int }_{0}^{3}\\text{d}y\\cdot {\\int }_{0}^{2}\\text{d}z \\\\  & =[3x]_{x=0}^{x=4}\\cdot (3-0)\\cdot (2-0) \\\\  & =(12-0)\\cdot 3\\cdot 2 \\\\  & =72.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["4c27ed1e-c805-56df-b90b-eaa5a3199381"] :db/ensure :question/validate} {:db/id "4f85cd44-af17-57ec-b3e1-4a6bfc979738" :answer/id #uuid "4f85cd44-af17-57ec-b3e1-4a6bfc979738" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "160" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "7a3d8850-b97a-5c6c-9fc9-5e352cc63c54" :answer/id #uuid "7a3d8850-b97a-5c6c-9fc9-5e352cc63c54" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "320" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "fdcca4b7-8539-5240-929a-cb57e96a526b" :answer/id #uuid "fdcca4b7-8539-5240-929a-cb57e96a526b" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "80" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "1f64c501-23ad-5895-bb85-cd421ce0e391" :answer/id #uuid "1f64c501-23ad-5895-bb85-cd421ce0e391" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-320" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "2b4b73ce-7f0f-5fcd-afe5-4c852f86ffec" :answer/id #uuid "2b4b73ce-7f0f-5fcd-afe5-4c852f86ffec" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "64" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "a368137c-3c2a-5f3a-bc0b-411f8e37fd7b" :answer-field/id #uuid "a368137c-3c2a-5f3a-bc0b-411f8e37fd7b" :answer-field/key "selection"