_{R}\\text{div}\\,F\\,\\text{d}V.\n$$\n\nComputing the divergence of $F,$ we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\text{div}\\,F & =\\frac{∂}{∂x}(5 x + 1)+\\frac{∂}{∂y}(3z)+\\frac{∂}{∂z}(xy) \\\\  & =5+0+0 \\\\  & =5.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nLet $R$ be the solid region enclosed by $S.$ Then, using the divergence theorem, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{∬}_{S}F\\cdot dS & ={∭}_{R}5\\,\\text{d}V \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{5}{\\int }_{0}^{4}{\\int }_{0}^{3}5\\,\\text{d}z\\,\\text{d}y\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{5}5\\,\\text{d}x\\cdot {\\int }_{0}^{4}\\text{d}y\\cdot {\\int }_{0}^{3}\\text{d}z \\\\  & =[5x]_{x=0}^{x=5}\\cdot (4-0)\\cdot (3-0) \\\\  & =(25-0)\\cdot 4\\cdot 3 \\\\  & =300.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["63c02e25-8ee6-5c9f-b462-f48435c790de"] :db/ensure :question/validate} {:db/id "e80972f0-e878-59aa-825c-1374c6505972" :answer/id #uuid "e80972f0-e878-59aa-825c-1374c6505972" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-168" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "c14d9583-f641-5ba8-a269-37856b6aa647" :answer/id #uuid "c14d9583-f641-5ba8-a269-37856b6aa647" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "56" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "8c4c8cc6-0565-52b9-b9f7-f6addd5c4f89" :answer/id #uuid "8c4c8cc6-0565-52b9-b9f7-f6addd5c4f89" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "84" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "eddb07c6-dc79-58ec-b504-1a50cd4dcb17" :answer/id #uuid "eddb07c6-dc79-58ec-b504-1a50cd4dcb17" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "42" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "5c29a741-00a0-515e-911a-eeee07458659" :answer/id #uuid "5c29a741-00a0-515e-911a-eeee07458659" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "168" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "e367539d-d01a-537d-bede-325402aa1114" :answer-field/id #uuid "e367539d-d01a-537d-bede-325402aa1114" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/choices ["e80972f0-e878-59aa-825c-1374c6