$\n\nComputing the divergence of $F,$ we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\text{div}\\,F & =\\frac{∂}{∂x}({e}^{z})+\\frac{∂}{∂y}({x}^{2}{y}^{2})+\\frac{∂}{∂z}(4{x}^{2}yz) \\\\  & =0+2 x^{2} y+4 x^{2} y \\\\  & =6{x}^{2}y.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nLet $R$ be the solid region enclosed by $S.$ Then, using the divergence theorem, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{∬}_{S}F\\cdot dS & ={∭}_{R}6{x}^{2}y\\,\\text{d}V \\\\  & ={\\int }_{1}^{2}{\\int }_{1}^{2}{\\int }_{0}^{2}6{x}^{2}y\\,\\text{d}z\\,\\text{d}y\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={\\int }_{1}^{2}3{x}^{2}\\,\\text{d}x\\cdot {\\int }_{1}^{2}2y\\,\\text{d}y\\cdot {\\int }_{0}^{2}\\text{d}z \\\\  & =[{x}^{3}]_{x=1}^{x=2}\\cdot [{y}^{2}]_{y=1}^{y=2}\\cdot (2-0) \\\\  & =(8-1)\\cdot (4-1)\\cdot 2 \\\\  & =42.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard :question/answer-fields ["0e98cec3-2eff-5a26-95ad-fd16d5b3952a"] :db/ensure :question/validate} {:db/id "be649ad5-b4e9-5d0c-a1a5-39aa52ff2977" :answer/id #uuid "be649ad5-b4e9-5d0c-a1a5-39aa52ff2977" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "57" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "db3cd37d-26c8-565b-a403-fb51d1549af5" :answer/id #uuid "db3cd37d-26c8-565b-a403-fb51d1549af5" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{76}{3}" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "5712fa33-2654-560a-953b-8ab341a87dac" :answer/id #uuid "5712fa33-2654-560a-953b-8ab341a87dac" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "38" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "d8ca3ef4-5b6a-5f8d-b1e9-486e15852860" :answer/id #uuid "d8ca3ef4-5b6a-5f8d-b1e9-486e15852860" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-114" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "c20f5bf6-6c83-5812-875c-16020afddb1d" :answer/id #uuid "c20f5bf6-6c83-5812-875c-16020afddb1d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "114" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "ba1ad2f9-147b-5908-9366-77e6127caa05" :answer-field/id #uuid "ba1ad2f9-147b-5908-9366-77e6127caa05" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-f